":false}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]哦～？照这么说……你什么都能造出来？[l]","charaName":"【米托拉】"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_67","text":"软铺盖，大枕头，还有蓬松的棉被！"},{"tag":"tag_67","text":"切肉台，大烤炉，能生猛火的石灶！"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_67"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"trans":true,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"layer":"chara1","noIn":false,"noOut":false,"alpha":1,"img":"chara002_0","x":302,"y":-754,"bright":1,"scaleX":1.5,"mirrow":false}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]嗯～这些倒是挺有吸引力的。[r][l]你就这么想活命呀，储备粮？[l]","charaName":"【米托拉】"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_68","text":"我还有需要做的事……。"},{"tag":"tag_68","text":"我要去找我的父亲……。"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_68"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]……[l][cm]","charaName":"【米托拉】"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_69"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]给我重新盖个营地。很容易吧？[l]","charaName":"【米托拉】"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_90","text":"营地……？"},{"tag":"tag_90","text":"营地？"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_70"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"trans":true,"scaleY":0.5,"layer":"fore","noIn":false,"noOut":false,"alpha":0,"img":"emoticon01","x":733,"y":552.5,"bright":1,"scaleX":0.5,"mirrow":false}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"trans":true,"transTime":300,"scaleY":0.5,"layer":"fore","noIn":false,"noOut":false,"alpha":0,"img":"emoticon01","x":733,"y":552.5,"bright":1,"scaleX":0.5,"mirrow":false}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]对的。[r]比之前的营帐还要大，还要坚固。[l][cm]风吹不破，砂也灌不进来，再鬼祟的魔物也没法摸进来偷我的粮食吃。[l][cm]","charaName":"【米托拉】"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_71"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"trans":true,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"layer":"fore","noIn":false,"noOut":false,"alpha":1,"img":"emoticon01","x":731,"y":552.5,"bright":1,"scaleX":1.5,"mirrow":false}},{"key":"wait","para":{"